OL,3,GNEWSAFledgling roller hockey team
OL,4,Aattends Euro tournament
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey roller hockey team is to take
OL,7,Fpart in a European tournament after
OL,8,Fonly being founded a year ago.
OL,10,FFarnham Roller Hockey Club's under-17s
OL,11,Ffemale team will represent the town at
OL,12,Fthe upcoming Eurockey International
OL,13,FTournament in Blanes and Lloret de Mar,
OL,14,FSpain.
OL,16,FLucy Collis, who coached the squad last
OL,17,Fyear, said: "Playing together on the
OL,18,FEuropean stage for the first time is a
OL,19,Fmajor moment."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
